stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> idle

  idle --> queued : submit
  queued --> running : start

  running --> paused : pause
  paused --> running : resume

  running --> completed : success
  running --> failed : error
  running --> idle : stop

  paused --> idle : stop
  queued --> idle : stop

  failed --> queued : retry

  completed --> [*]
